    "hanzi": "聊天、看新闻，我都会。我儿子也帮我开通了，可是我就是不肯绑银行卡。上个月隔壁王阿姨接到一个电话，说她的账户出了问题，让她把验证码告诉他们，差点儿被骗走两万块。",
    "pinyin": "liáotiān, kàn xīnwén, wǒ dōu huì. wǒ érzi yě bāng wǒ kāitōng le, kěshì wǒ jiùshì bù kěn bǎng yínhángkǎ. shàng gè yuè gébì Wáng'āyí jiē dào yī gè diànhuà, shuō tā de zhànghù chū le wèntí, ràng tā bǎ yànzhèngmǎ gàosu tāmen, chàdiǎnr bèi piàn zǒu liǎng wàn kuài.",
    "en": "Chatting, reading the news, I can do all that. My son even set it up for me, but I just won't link my bank card. Last month Auntie Wang next door got a call saying there was a problem with her account and asking for her verification code, and she nearly got conned out of twenty thousand."
