    "pinyin": "Gùlǎoshī, nín bié guāng xiào wǒmen. shàng cì wǔxiū de shíhou, wǒ kànjiàn nín yīzhí zài shuā lǎo Shànghǎi de shìpín, hái xiào chū le shēng.",
