    "hanzi": "话说回来，做父母的也不容易。我女儿今年三十了，我嘴上不说，心里也急。",
    "pinyin": "huàshuōhuílái, zuò fùmǔ de yě bù róngyì. wǒ nǚ'ér jīnnián sānshí le, wǒ zuǐ shang bù shuō, xīnli yě jí.",
    "en": "That said, it isn't easy being a parent either. My daughter's thirty this year. I don't say anything, but inside I worry too."
