    "pinyin": "mā, wǒ yě xiǎng ràng tā qīngsōng yīdiǎnr a. kěshì míngnián jiù yào xiǎoshēngchū le, hǎode chūzhōng jìngzhēng nàme jīliè, wǒ bùdébù zǎo zuò zhǔnbèi.",
    "en": "Mum, I want him to have an easier time too. But next year he moves up to secondary school, and competition for the good ones is so fierce I've no choice but to prepare early."
