    "hanzi": "我在英国上学的时候，最重要的考试是十六岁和十八岁那两次。小学放学以后，基本上就是踢球。",
    "pinyin": "wǒ zài yīngguó shàng xué de shíhou, zuì zhòngyào de kǎoshì shì shí liù suì hé shí bā suì nà liǎng cì. xiǎoxué fàng xué yǐhòu, jīběnshang jiùshì tī qiú.",
    "en": "When I was at school in Britain, the exams that really mattered were at sixteen and eighteen. At primary school, after school was basically football."
