    "hanzi": "叔叔好，我是小雨的邻居，在骨科当护士。说句实话，换了关节以后，最怕的就是一直躺着。医生一般都要求尽早下地活动，每天做康复训练，不然关节容易僵硬。",
    "pinyin": "shūshu hǎo, wǒ shì Xiǎoyǔ de línjū, zài gǔkē dāng hùshi. shuōjùshíhuà, huàn le guānjié yǐhòu, zuì pà de jiùshì yīzhí tǎng zhe. yīshēng yībān dōu yāoqiú jǐnzǎo xiàdì huódòng, měitiān zuò kāngfùxùnliàn, bùrán guānjié róngyì jiāngyìng.",
    "en": "Hello, uncle. I'm Xiaoyu's neighbour, a nurse on an orthopaedic ward. To be honest, after a joint replacement, the worst thing you can do is stay lying down. Doctors usually want you up and moving as soon as possible, doing your rehab exercises every day. Otherwise the joint gets stiff."
