    "pinyin": "āyí, nín xiān chá cha zhège zhuānjiā shì shéi, zài nǎ jiā yīyuàn. yánjiūbiǎomíng, gǔtoutāng lǐ de gài qíshí shǎo de kělián, hē xiàqu de dà duō shì yóu. yào bǔgài, bùrú hē niúnǎi, chī dòufu.",
    "en": "Auntie, first check who this 'expert' is and which hospital he works at. Research shows there's hardly any calcium in bone soup. Most of what you drink is fat. If he needs calcium, milk and tofu are much better."
