    "pinyin": "hǎohǎo hǎo, wǒ shuō buguò nǐmen. kěshì zhème rè de tiān, tā zài wū lǐ hái bù kěn kāi kōngtiáo, shuō chuī duōle huì dé kōngtiáobìng.",
    "en": "All right, all right, I can't argue with the lot of you. But in this heat he still won't turn the air conditioning on indoors. He says too much of it gives you 'air-con sickness'."
